namespace TemplateContracts;

@doc("Published by TS Finance after the hourly `CaptureFxRates` scheduler appends a new FxRate (one per currency pair per hour). FxRates are append-only and never overwrite — the same (pair, startDate) tuple is silently no-op'd if already present. Analytics consumes to invalidate any query cache that was waiting on a fresher rate for the captured `startDate` window.")
